{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A heart-warming, creature-collecting metroidvania  you've never seen before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where dogs live on forever amongst the stars as LAIKA Space Rovers, you pilot an energetic canine rover with a new lease on life! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and research alien creatures, harnessing their abilities to explore the lush world of Terra II! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; customize your tools and homebase! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests for your fellow LAIKA companions and help them unravel the ancient mystery of a lost civilization!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/8236b1c8cda955b0d52d1952040e55f4.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/7b22f351461a3f6a81a509ca94b32535.poster.avif?t=1773349805\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/7b22f351461a3f6a81a509ca94b32535.webm?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/7b22f351461a3f6a81a509ca94b32535.mp4?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an Anomaly is detected on the remote, alien planet Terra II, a Human explorer is sent out to investigate. After a bumpy landing, the Human's S.O.S beacon awakens a nearby, dormant LAIKA Rover. Together, you'll go on a journey to find the Anomaly, and unravel the story behind it's mysterious origin. Form an unbreakable bond, as you work together to complete the Human's mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/ce6d4002ea3bb0eb12a871d00474b822.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/4f4387454f56d04bccdd74b50173eefa.poster.avif?t=1773349805\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/4f4387454f56d04bccdd74b50173eefa.webm?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/4f4387454f56d04bccdd74b50173eefa.mp4?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of tools and upgrades to capture the exotic creatures of Terra II. Harness their unique abilities to overcome obstacles and expand the world, or bring them back to Homebase where they can be scanned for Research Credits. The living, breathing ecosystem of Terra II is at your disposal!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/857cb3b6a76b73f099914d233f210631.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/2a7843ed6653eb12648753e971ec565d.poster.avif?t=1773349805\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/2a7843ed6653eb12648753e971ec565d.webm?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/2a7843ed6653eb12648753e971ec565d.mp4?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The LAIKA Program gave old dogs a new lease on life by transferring their consciousness into LAIKA Rovers, allowing them to live on forever as a brave space explorers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and reboot your sleeping canine companions, become best friends, and work together to help The Human with their mission. Complete quests for the Rovers to receive unique rewards, and help them remember their past by unlocking their hidden memory tapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/d011bfa52b4be7dd86e770e8314f8b80.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/19661b05dcbd76d4ccfdfdf0530ca3b3.poster.avif?t=1773349805\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/19661b05dcbd76d4ccfdfdf0530ca3b3.webm?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/19661b05dcbd76d4ccfdfdf0530ca3b3.mp4?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into the hidden depths of Terra II! Explore sprawling caves and discover ancient temples, as you uncover the history of the planet and it's previous inhabitants. Who were they? Where did they go?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/dbcdfb1383d1939dd0ec42b1e4e769c4.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/2704b1806501f80c6a4752d3d8684140.poster.avif?t=1773349805\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/2704b1806501f80c6a4752d3d8684140.webm?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/2704b1806501f80c6a4752d3d8684140.mp4?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the familiar yet alien planet of Terra II.\u00a0Utilize your upgrades and creature abilities to adapt to the different biomes, from lush forests to stinky swamps and snowy mountain tops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/682c898e71e627678e054424afe7bead.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/f048a58cd0a81e65ab8361484023a9a3.poster.avif?t=1773349805\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/f048a58cd0a81e65ab8361484023a9a3.webm?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/f048a58cd0a81e65ab8361484023a9a3.mp4?t=1773349805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your Rover your own! Upgrade your arsenal with new tools and capturing equipment. Maximize your exploring capabilities with upgrade modules. Expand your wardrobe, unlock new cosmetics, and become the most fashionable Rover on Terra II! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2986110?t=1773349805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/acdd76a20f84a1fea58dedec032535bdba07c8d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773349805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/43a3df4a8cf91328e58fb31f70419918f76112a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773349805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/43a3df4a8cf91328e58fb31f70419918f76112a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773349805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4341820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A heart-warming, creature-collecting metroidvania  you've never seen before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where dogs live on forever amongst the stars as LAIKA Space Rovers, you pilot an energetic canine rover with a new lease on life! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and research alien creatures, harnessing their abilities to explore the lush world of Terra II! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; customize your tools and homebase! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests for your fellow LAIKA companions and help them unravel the ancient mystery of a lost civilization!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986110/extras/8236b1c8cda955b0d52d1952040e55f4.avif?t=1773349805\" width=1560 height=164 /></span></h